On the Odin vs Zig allocator bit: In Zig you pass an allocator to every function that allocates, even if it doesn't make a lot of sense. const arr = std.ArrayList(i64).empty;
arr.append(allocator, 1);
arr.append(allocator, 2);
arr.append(allocator, 3);
